        (
            name: "get-internet-event",
            description: Some("Gets information that Amazon CloudWatch Internet Monitor has generated about an internet event. Internet Monitor displays information about recent global health events, called internet events, on a global outages map that is available to all Amazon Web Services customers.  The information returned here includes the impacted location, when the event started and (if the event is over) ended, the type of event (PERFORMANCE or AVAILABILITY), and the status (ACTIVE or RESOLVED)"),
