            name: "get-query-status",
            description: Some("Returns the current status of a query for the Amazon CloudWatch Internet Monitor query interface, for a specified query ID and monitor. When you run a query, check the status to make sure that the query has SUCCEEDED before you review the results.    QUEUED: The query is scheduled to run.    RUNNING: The query is in progress but not complete.    SUCCEEDED: The query completed sucessfully.    FAILED: The query failed due to an error.    CANCELED: The query was canceled"),
